++/* Coachz: the attachments of a pass that metal2vulkan's runtime knows no draw of it writes, reads or blends and whose loads and stores
++ * are DONT_CARE (a Metal memoryless color in the first instance it records inline): chained to VkRenderPassCreateInfo2 by the runtime,
++ * a private structure no other caller uses. Their subpass references count as VK_ATTACHMENT_UNUSED here, so they take no GMEM and no
